# The de Havilland Mosquito FB.VI's sounds, synthesised (src/audio/sound_set.hpp says each line).
# Placeholders until Phase 15's recordings: every figure below but her
# engines' cylinders is a stand-in, chosen to sound like her kind of
# aeroplane, not taken from a source.

# Two Rolls-Royce Merlin 25s: twelve cylinders each.
# Her note follows the flight model's engine RPM.
engine piston 12 0.28
wind 0.15 220
gear 400 0.06
flaps 600 0.05
touchdown 0.40
stall-warning 14 900 0.10
# Another aircraft's engine is heard at about her cruise RPM.
heard-as-other 2650
